<title>BAHRAIN: TABLE-Saudi SCECO-West loss narrows in past year.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Saudi SCECO-West loss narrows in past year.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to June 1997</p>
<p>			     (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net loss		    976.0   vs   1,090.0</p>
<p> Income		    1,828.7   vs   1,783.4</p>
<p> Expenses		  3,068.1   vs   2,959.7</p>
<p> Other income		264.4   vs	86.2</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds   7,745.2   vs   7,862.4</p>
<p> Assets		   35,300.6   vs  33,803.8</p>
<p>Full Name: The Saudi Consolidated Electric Company - West.</p>
<p>Note - The firm is one of four major power companies in the kingdom. The four are majority government-owned.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424.</p>
</text>
